    "title": "Carroll stays undefeated in conference play with 2-0 win over Evergreen Geoducks - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Josh Dugan NonStop Local ,\n8 hours ago HELENA, Mont. — The Carroll College men’s soccer team picked up a 2-0 win over the Evergreen Geoducks Saturday to stay unbeaten in Cascade Collegiate Conference matchup. The Saints first goal came early in the second half when a Sam Loughton header found the back of the net. Credit Nicolas Sanchez and Jake Dicely for the assist. Read full article",
